{"class":"ScriptBox","name":"ScriptBox","props":{"fibA":"89","fibB":"144","PanelBuilt":"1","LastMember":"/Root/Palette/ScriptBox/Output","ReservedViewResizeable":"0","ReservedViewPanelY":"184","ReservedViewPanelX":"82","ReservedViewOpen":"1","Name":"ScriptBox_1","Deletable":"1","Container":"/Root","H":"490","W":"440","Y":"35","X":"477","ReservedOut":"Output","ReservedIn":"In","Evt":"0","LanguageList":"Forth,JSScript,Lua","Output":"89","State":"0","In":"0","Run":"","Source":"( next Fibonacci number on every activate. State lives in properties on this\n    box - the dictionary is shared and a re-run recompiles, so a Forth variable\n    is the wrong place for it. )\n  \n  64 string BUF\n  \n  : N>S  ( n -- addr )    \"%ld\" BUF strform  BUF ;\n  : S>N  ( addr -- n )    strint swap drop ;\n  \n  : FIB\n     \"fibB\" getprop S>N            ( b, or 0 on the very first run )\n     dup 0= if drop 1 then         ( seed it to 1 )\n     dup N>S print                 ( show this one )\n     \"fibA\" getprop S>N            ( b a )\n     over +                        ( b c )\n     \"fibB\" swap N>S setprop       ( fibB := c )\n     \"fibA\" swap N>S setprop       ( fibA := b )\n  ;\n  \n  FIB","Language":"Forth","Enable":"1"},"wires":[{"from":"LastMember","to":"/DefaultApp/WebGUI/WebBridge","port":"Taps"},{"from":"ReservedViewResizeable","to":"/DefaultApp/WebGUI/WebBridge","port":"Taps"},{"from":"ReservedViewPanelY","to":"/DefaultApp/WebGUI/WebBridge","port":"Taps"},{"from":"ReservedViewPanelX","to":"/DefaultApp/WebGUI/WebBridge","port":"Taps"},{"from":"ReservedViewOpen","to":"/DefaultApp/WebGUI/WebBridge","port":"Taps"},{"from":"Container","to":"/DefaultApp/WebGUI/WebBridge","port":"Taps"},{"from":"H","to":"/DefaultApp/WebGUI/WebBridge","port":"Taps"},{"from":"W","to":"/DefaultApp/WebGUI/WebBridge","port":"Taps"},{"from":"Y","to":"/DefaultApp/WebGUI/WebBridge","port":"Taps"},{"from":"X","to":"/DefaultApp/WebGUI/WebBridge","port":"Taps"}],"children":[{"class":"Button","name":"But